  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 25 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nIf you’ve been searching for that effortless coastal lifestyle with single-level simplicity and an unbeatable location to match, this absolute gem is calling your name!\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of the Hibiscus Coast's most desirable pockets, this property hits the sweet spot for downsizers, professionals, and savvy investors looking for low-maintenance, easy-care living. \r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, a light-filled open-plan layout connects the living and dining spaces, making everyday living and hosting friends completely effortless. Accommodation is brilliantly catered for, featuring two well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master complete with its own private ensuite. To complete the layout, a family bathroom is complemented by a convenient separate toilet for guests.\r\n\r\nPracticality is taken to the next level with a single internal access garage providing secure parking and easy storage. Plus, you also get a double carport, offering plenty of extra room to park additional vehicles or water toys with total ease.\r\n\r\nLocation truly doesn't get better than this! Leave the car at home and soak up everything Orewa has to offer. You're within walking distance to local shops, Orewa Beach, nearby schools, and the scenic Te Ara Tahuna Estuary walkway.\r\n\r\nYour dream coastal lifestyle starts here - contact us today to arrange a viewing before it's gone!",
